data: {"id": "3cb5f16946314303-final", "run_id": "3cb5f16946314303", "seq": 694, "ts_ms": 1789379103675, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v15/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod `aiops-case-v15/workload` 处于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态，容器重启 8 次，`Ready=False`。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Config | `container.resource_limit.memory` | `64Mi` | 定义容器 `app` 的硬内存上限 |\n| 2 | Logging | `log.message` | `startup allocation 256Mi` | 应用日志显示启动时分配了 256Mi 内存 |\n| 3 | K8s State | `container.last_terminated_reason` | `OOMKilled` | 明确指示上一轮进程因内存不足被强制终止 |\n| 4 | K8s State | `container.last_exit_code` | `137` | 信号 137 对应进程被 OOM Killer 杀除的标识 |\n| 5 | K8s Event | `BackOff` | `Back-off restarting failed container app` (x71 over 17m) | 确认集群层面持续检测到重启失败并指数退避 |\n| 6 | Metric | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` | `8` | 量化验证了 Pod 的活跃重启次数 |\n\n**证据分析：**\n配置事实（#1）与日志事实（#2）直接构成了资源供需矛盾的因果闭环：启动需求（256Mi）远超硬限制（64Mi）。状态事实（#3, #4）精准记录了由此触发的操作系统级保护行为（OOMKilled/137），这与配置矛盾在逻辑上完全自洽。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n配置错误：容器 memory Limit (64Mi) 小于应用启动分配需求 (256Mi) \n→ 失败机制：启动阶段触发 Linux OOM Killer \n→ 直接失败：容器以 OOMKilled 和 Exit Code 137 终止 \n→ 用户可见现象：Pod 进入 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，Ready=False\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为**内存资源配置严重不足**（证据 #1, #2）。\n应用启动逻辑尝试分配 256Mi 内存，超过了容器 64Mi 的硬限制，直接导致 Linux OOM Killer 介入并终止容器进程（证据 #3, #4）。Kubernetes 检测到容器异常退出（证据 #5, #6）后，不断尝试重启但持续失败，最终表现为 `CrashLoopBackOff`。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 13.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 42.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v15/workload: 42.3s (Evidence 30.2s, RCA 12.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v15/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 64.122, "metrics": {"run_id": "3cb5f16946314303", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 64.12802219390869, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 64128.02219390869, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 60882.609844207764, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 8033.643484115601, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2800.6274700164795}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 13610.196113586426, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 42308.43925476074, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"nam